{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>Like the peaks of a re'em for him.</b> That is to say, twofold doubled — his strength is double that of a re'em. תועפות is a term of doubling, as the Targum renders: וכפלת ותעיף, and likewise תעופה בבקר תהיה — that your light should be double the light of morning. And the Holy One, blessed be He, compares Himself to a re'em in order to make people listen, and likewise He is compared to a lion: ה' כאריה ישאג, אריה שאג — מי לא יירא."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:10:03.626126330Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}